  "manually_transcribed_clean_11th_from_original_first_edition": "When to the eleventh, it signifies a cheerfull heart and person, the encrease of the Native's Friends, it imports the yeer to be very prosperous in all worldly affaires, and it invites the Native to bestirre himselfe and husband time well, whereby he may much advance his private fortune, &c.",
